Development only: pytest (MIT), ruff (MIT), Pillow (MIT-CMU).


## Data

BIRD (https://bird-bench.github.io/) is not redistributed here and nothing in
this repository downloads it. Whoever runs the benchmark places the dev split
in data/bird/ themselves. Its licence is stated inconsistently by its own
sources, CC BY-NC 4.0 in the datasheet of the original paper and CC BY-SA 4.0
on later dataset cards, so read the terms at the source before relying on it,
commercially in particular.

The held-out set under src/nl2sql_app/holdout/ is generated rather than
collected. It contains no third-party data and falls under this repository's
own licence.
